# Source PDFs. These are ~100 MB of College Board and publisher material that
# the app never loads at runtime -- only extract_bank.py reads them, and only
# when regenerating banks/. Committing them would bloat the repo permanently
# and redistribute copyrighted content.
book/*.pdf

# Raw API responses cached by fetch_math.py -- 1,876 files of College Board's
# own JSON, regenerable by re-running it. Same reasoning as the PDFs above:
# source material the app never loads, only extract_math.py reads.
book/math-api/

.claude/

# Byte-code from the extract_*.py scripts
__pycache__/

# OS and editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
